### Prerequisites: Create editorial, autor, genero first

### Create editorial for libro tests (201)
POST http://localhost:8000/editoriales/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Editorial Test",
  "pais": "Argentina"
}

### Create autor for libro tests (201)
POST http://localhost:8000/autores/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Autor Test",
  "nacionalidad": "Argentina"
}

### Create genero for libro tests (201)
POST http://localhost:8000/generos/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ficción"
}

### Create libro with authors - success (201)
POST http://localhost:8000/libros/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "978-987-1234-56-7",
  "titulo": "El Libro de Prueba",
  "precio": "29.99",
  "stock": 10,
  "editorial_id": 1,
  "genero_id": 1,
  "autores": [
    {
      "autor_id": 1,
      "rol": "autor",
      "orden": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Create libro - duplicate ISBN (409)
POST http://localhost:8000/libros/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "978-987-1234-56-7",
  "titulo": "Otro Libro",
  "precio": "19.99",
  "stock": 5,
  "editorial_id": 1,
  "genero_id": 1,
  "autores": [
    {
      "autor_id": 1,
      "rol": "autor",
      "orden": 1
    }
  ]
}

